{"title":"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Alternate_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb87a3665fb59dbcd9596b0df4f43b402970a721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{x_1}=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/6/8c67cbcfbe58d11956c67bc0409ec1404e702a37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{x_2}=6$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a02485fa767421348ba260e4388a1825019309.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{x_3}=7$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, ... , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/0937b07c3e346a9cb8d73cd3fa8a2f0109301c4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$127^{x_{124}}=128$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />.  What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf2fbbd3e4296a47e29abdf2fb1d8cf2cd06ed0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1x_2...x_{124}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8874c769ae99cf93e07c8b6afc67378fbaa0cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ {{{2}}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ {{{\\frac{5}{2}}}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ {{{3}}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ {{{\\frac{7}{2}}}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ {{{4}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"350\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that we can re-write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb87a3665fb59dbcd9596b0df4f43b402970a721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{x_1}=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/6/8c67cbcfbe58d11956c67bc0409ec1404e702a37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{x_2}=6$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a02485fa767421348ba260e4388a1825019309.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{x_3}=7$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, ... , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/0937b07c3e346a9cb8d73cd3fa8a2f0109301c4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$127^{x_{124}}=128$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/8211404ef93061e622f2026ab7783b588da2e6b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(...\\left(\\left(\\left(4^{x_1}\\right)^{x_2}\\right)^{x_3}\\right)...\\right)^{x_{124}}=128$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"227\" height=\"23\" /> by using substitution. By using the properties of exponents, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82d09ece3b46ba4ac4513a85582f5dc413f1d789.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{x_1x_2...x_{124}}=128$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"126\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/1/6217361ba4a641e2137eeb3ace79ebe00fbc44ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{x_1x_2...x_{124}}=128\\\\2^{2x_1x_2...x_{124}}=2^7\\\\2x_1x_2...x_{124}=7\\\\x_1x_2...x_{124}=\\dfrac{7}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"126\" height=\"93\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/6/6867cb238b3ec0641401f5e3e3f9fc1a0ecba186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\,\\dfrac{7}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"56\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_Solution\">Alternate Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Alternate Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Changing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb87a3665fb59dbcd9596b0df4f43b402970a721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{x_1}=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> to logarithmic form, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/e/1eec5d2eadc185970150d658bf20e82dda1d2be5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${x_1}=\\log_{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />.  We can rewrite this as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/437ffe69e194483a8d48e92317e50d1e99276f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${x_1}=\\dfrac{\\log{5}}{\\log{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"80\" height=\"41\" />.  Applying this to the rest, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e594eea84a16caef95d12cae278d40a5d91d0c52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1x_2...x_{124}=\\dfrac{\\log5}{\\log4}\\cdot\\dfrac{\\log6}{\\log5}\\cdot...\\cdot\\dfrac{\\log128}{\\log127}=\\dfrac{\\log5\\cdot\\log6\\cdot...\\cdot\\log128}{\\log4\\cdot\\log5\\cdot...\\cdot\\log127}=\\dfrac{\\log128}{\\log4}=\\log_{4}{128}=\\log_{4}{2^7}=7\\cdot\\log_{4}{2}=7\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{2}=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\,\\dfrac{7}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"976\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B\">2005 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title